Cell[TextData[{
 "For the curve E de\[FiLigature]ned by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["y", "2"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "a116266e-2629-47b4-8c0e-b6a01c02dd5f"],
 " + y = ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["x", "3"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "38a4be10-581f-4aec-bcef-e4c9721ba56d"],
 " + ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "a2b01299-714b-4ecd-af02-8d24325e9c61"],
 " we have four obvious points (0, 0), (\[Minus]1, 0) (0, \[Minus]1) = \
\[Minus](0, 0) and (\[Minus]1, \[Minus]1) = \[Minus](\[Minus]1, 0), on the \
curve. The point P = (0, 0) generates an in\[FiLigature]nite cyclic subgroup \
of E(Q)."
}], "Text",
